          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="proj">
          <div class="shot c5"><strong>Property Assistant</strong></div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="kind">WhatsApp chatbot for real estate</span>
            <h3>RAG Property Assistant</h3>
            <p>Answers enquiries, qualifies leads and sends follow-ups automatically. Saves agents 10+ hours of messaging every week.</p>
            <div class="chips"><span>N8N</span><span>OpenAI</span><span>RAG</span><span>WhatsApp API</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="proj">
          <div class="shot c4"><strong>Bizaro</strong></div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="kind">Event and invitation platform</span>
            <h3>Bizaro</h3>
            <p>AI-written content, countdown timers, RSVPs and WhatsApp notifications. Grew to 1,500+ users in year one with 200% more engagement.</p>
